<h2>Sending a correction</h2>
<p>Use the <a href="/corrections/">corrections page</a>, linked from every section of the site.
A source URL is required &mdash; a correction with no source to check it against can't be
accepted. Accepted corrections are committed with a source and a checked date within a week.</p>
